Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:03:13.80,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}1 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}2{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 查拉耶娃 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:09.55,EN,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, she'll turn 24 years of age
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:09.55,ZH,,0,0,1186,,明天 她就要满{\fs78}24{\fs68}岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.83,EN,,0,0,0,,as Zheng Qinwen wraps up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,郑钦文给自己赢下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.83,0:00:14.15,EN,,0,0,0,,a well-earned early birthday present
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.83,0:00:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,一份来之不易的提前生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in Beijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在北京
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.18,EN,,0,0,0,,The tussle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场鏖战终于结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:23.06,EN,,0,0,0,,and what a tussle it ended up being.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:23.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真是一场激烈的较量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Dominating the opening set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在第一盘占据优势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.18,EN,,0,0,0,,but had to gut out a win in two hours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还是苦战了两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:28.86,EN,,0,0,0,,and eleven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,又十一分钟 才赢下这场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and Zheng Qinwen for the second time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是郑钦文第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in four appearances is a quarter-finalist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:34.00,ZH,,0,0,1186,,在四次参赛中打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:34.70,EN,,0,0,0,,in Beijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在北京
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:39.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Qinwen, a great match, proper battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:39.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文 打得真好 真是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常非常的艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,又是一个三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先和我们来分享一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场比赛好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.14,0:00:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实我一上来打得挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:51.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是各种技术都在线
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能到第二盘的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.42,0:00:54.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得整个人有点下降
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,再加上天气越来越冷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我觉得这个球速
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:00:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,变得越来越慢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:01:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,但是我还是非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,现场一直坚守到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,为我支持的球迷朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:13.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是我已经很久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有打夜场了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实是要时间适应一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,再加上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实非常[未清]这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,也为了现场所有的观众们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, well first of all, I would like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.70,EN,,0,0,0,,to say I had a great match today, especially
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我打得很好 尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:38.06,EN,,0,0,0,,in the first set I play really aggressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘 我打得很主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,but I think there is up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and down the second set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一些起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:43.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't keep the same focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:43.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有保持同样的专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm really grateful, like [unclear]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很感谢 ［此处未辨清］
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.78,EN,,0,0,0,,would cheer for me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:47.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚为我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:50.14,EN,,0,0,0,,and in the third set that was really tough
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘 真的很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,[unclear] I'm glad that at the end I got a win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.14,0:01:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,［未辨清］很高兴最后赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:57.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and thank you so much all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:01.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, obviously today is the very last day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:01.24,ZH,,0,0,1186,,今天是你{\fs78}23{\fs68}岁的最后一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:05.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of your 23 year old with this win What
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:05.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下了这场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.58,EN,,0,0,0,,was that exception wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:08.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,你有什么期许
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.50,EN,,0,0,0,,to your 24 year old?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.50,ZH,,0,0,1186,,对即将到来的{\fs78}24{\fs68}岁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天是郑钦文的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:14.85,ZH,,0,0,1186,,{\fs78}23{\fs68} 岁的最后一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下这场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:18.89,ZH,,0,0,1186,,郑钦文对自己的 {\fs78}24{\fs68} 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么期许
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只能说一切来得太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的记忆还停留在可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.59,0:02:28.47,ZH,,0,0,1186,,我 {\fs78}21{\fs68} 岁 {\fs78}22{\fs68} 岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:31.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,也可能因为伤病停了一年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,导致我的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:33.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直停留在过去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:35.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道现场大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.07,0:02:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,是否都认为时间过得太快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:39.95,ZH,,0,0,1186,,我还没有做好 {\fs78}24{\fs68} 岁的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.59,ZH,,0,0,1186,,因为在我看来 {\fs78}24{\fs68} 岁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经要是一个成熟的大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.63,0:02:45.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,但是我有些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:46.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有这么感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:51.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我只能说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.41,0:02:53.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,我期待未来的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,也希望每个年龄阶段的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:03:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,都能带给我不一样的体验
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,在此我们提前在现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.85,0:03:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,给钦文送一个生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,来我们全场的观众朋友一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.33,0:03:10.77,ZH,,0,0,1186,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:11.21,ZH,,0,0,1186,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.71,ZH,,0,0,1186,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,[Applause and indistinct voices]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声 夹杂未辨识人声
